  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have honed your proficiency with particular skills, granting you the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li><li>You gain proficiency in one skill of your choice.</li><li>Choose one skill in which you have proficiency. You gain expertise with that skill. The skill you choose must not be already benefiting from a feature, such as Expertise.</li></ul>",
